SOLUTION 1 Pure_DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05 mol/kgw

SOLUTION 2 Pure_Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05 mol/kgw

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_mix.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -si Calcite
END